      "answer": "a. The points show a strong positive, approximately linear association.\n\nb. $\\bar x=3$, $\\bar y=24$, slope $b=7$, and intercept $a=3$, so $\\hat y=3+7x$.\n\nc. $r\\approx0.9272$.\n\nd. At $x=6$, predicted production is $\\hat y=3+7(6)=45$ units.",
